#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In this window you will find predefined regular expressions. Both regular "
"expressions you have developed and saved, and regular expressions shipped "
"with the system."
msgstr ""
"U ovom prozoru nalaze se unaprijed definirani regularni izrazi. I regularni "
"izrazi koje ste razvili i spremili, i regularni izrazi isporučeni sa "
"sustavom."

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In this window you will develop your regular expressions. Select one of the "
"actions from the action buttons above, and click the mouse in this window to "
"insert the given action."
msgstr ""
"U ovom prozoru razvijat ćete svoje regularne izraze. Odaberite jednu od "
"radnji pomoću gumba radnji iznad i kliknite mišem u ovom prozoru da biste "
"umetnuli zadanu radnju."

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Type in some text in this window, and see what the regular expression you "
"have developed matches.</p><p>Each second match will be colored in red and "
"each other match will be colored blue, simply so you can distinguish them "
"from each other.</p><p>If you select part of the regular expression in the "
"editor window, then this part will be highlighted - This allows you to "
"<i>debug</i> your regular expressions</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Upišite neki tekst u ovaj prozor i pogledajte što se podudara s "
"regularnim izrazom koji ste razvili.</p><p>Svako drugo podudaranje bit će "
"obojeno crveno, a svako ostalo plavo, samo da ih možete razlikovati "
"međusobno.</p><p>Ako odaberete dio regularnog izraza u prozoru uređivača, "
"taj će dio biti istaknut – to vam omogućuje <i>otklanjanje grešaka</i> u "
"vašim regularnim izrazima</p>"

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgid "ASCII syntax:"
msgstr "ASCII sintaksa:"

#: kregexpeditorprivate.cpp:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>This is the regular expression in ASCII syntax. You are likely only to be "
"interested in this if you are a programmer, and need to develop a regular "
"expression using QRegExp.</p><p>You may develop your regular expression both "
"by using the graphical editor, and by typing the regular expression in this "
"line edit.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ovo je regularni izraz u ASCII sintaksi. Vjerojatno će vas zanimati samo "
"ako ste programer i trebate razviti regularni izraz pomoću QRegExp.</p><p>"
"Svoj regularni izraz možete razvijati i pomoću grafičkog uređivača i "
"upisivanjem regularnog izraza u ovo polje za uređivanje retka.</p>"

